  "description": "The Oxva NexLIM Pod Vape Kit delivers a perfect balance of portability, style, and advanced performance, making it an excellent choice for vapers seeking a compact yet powerful device. Featuring a sleek and ergonomic design with durable zinc alloy and aluminium construction, the NexLIM is a lightweight, pocket-friendly device that doesn't compromise on features. Powered by a 1500mAh built-in battery, the NexLIM supports up to 40W of power output, ensuring exceptional performance for both mouth-to-lung (MTL) and restricted direct-to-lung (RDL) vaping styles. The intuitive 0.85” colour screen provides clear, at-a-glance access to power settings, battery life, and vaping modes, while the ergonomic adjustable airflow system lets you fine-tune your draw to suit your preferences. The NexLIM comes with Oxva’s advanced 2ml TPD-compliant refillable pods, engineered with dual mesh technology for superior flavour delivery and coil longevity. The pod options include 0.6ohm and 0.8ohm coils, perfectly optimised for smooth MTL and RDL performance with nic salts and 50/50 e-liquids. The leakproof Unitech 2.0 design and top-fill system make refilling easy and mess-free, ensuring a hassle-free vaping experience. Combining premium build quality, smart technology, and versatile performance, the Oxva NexLIM Pod Kit is the ideal all-day companion for vapers looking for style, flavour, and simplicity in one sleek device. We recommend paring this kit with the following e-liquids: OXVA Xlim Top Fill 0.6ohm RDTL - Use 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquids OXVA Xlim Top Fill 0.8ohm MTL - Use 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquids Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
